"Learn More" = "了解更多";
"Tip title" = "提示标题";
"Tip content" = "提示内容";
"iTerm2 tip of the day" = "iTerm2 每日提示";
"See Tips of the Day?" = "查看每日提示？";
"iTerm2 can show you a Tip of the Day message to help you learn about its many features. Are you interested?" = "iTerm2 可向你显示每日提示消息，帮助你了解其众多功能。你感兴趣吗？";
"Yes" = "是";
"No" = "否";
"Dismiss Tip" = "关闭提示";
"Fewer Options" = "更少选项";
"More Options" = "更多选项";
"Show This Later" = "稍后显示";
"Disable Tips" = "禁用提示";
"Enable Tips" = "启用提示";
"Show Next Tip" = "显示下一条提示";
"Show Previous Tip" = "显示上一条提示";
"Show Tips Weekly" = "每周显示提示";
"Show Tips Daily" = "每天显示提示";
"Share" = "分享";
"iTerm2 Tip of the Day" = "iTerm2 每日提示";
"Tip of the Day" = "每日提示";
"This window shows the iTerm2 tip of the day. It’ll appear every 24 hours to let you know about new features and hidden secrets. Hit “More Options” to view more tips or to stop getting them altogether." = "此窗口显示 iTerm2 每日提示。它每 24 小时出现一次，让你了解新功能和隐藏技巧。点击“更多选项”可查看更多提示或完全停止接收。";
"Shell Integration" = "Shell 集成";
"The big new feature of iTerm2 version 3 is Shell Integration. Click “Learn More” for all the details." = "iTerm2 版本 3 的重大新功能是 Shell 集成。点击“了解更多”获取所有详情。";
"Timestamps" = "时间戳";
"“View > Show Timestamps” shows the time (and date, if appropriate) when each line was last modified." = "“视图 > 显示时间戳”会显示每行最后修改的时间（及日期，如适用）。";
"Password Manager" = "密码管理器";
"Did you know iTerm2 has a password manager? Open it with “Window > Password Manager.” You can define a Trigger to open it for you at a password prompt in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Triggers.”" = "你知道 iTerm2 有密码管理器吗？用“窗口 > 密码管理器”打开它。你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 高级 > 触发器”中定义一个触发器，在密码提示处自动打开它。";
"Open Quickly" = "快速打开";
"You can quickly search through your sessions with “View > Open Quickly” (⇧⌘O). You can type a query and sessions whose name, badge, current hostname, current user name, recent commands, and recent working directories match will be surfaced. It works best with Shell Integration so the user name, hostname, command, and directories can be known even while sshed." = "你可以用“视图 > 快速打开”（⇧⌘O）快速搜索会话。输入查询后，名称、徽章、当前主机名、当前用户名、最近命令和最近工作目录匹配的会话将会显示。配合 Shell 集成效果最佳，这样即使在 ssh 连接中也能知道用户名、主机名、命令和目录。";
"Undo Close" = "撤销关闭";
"If you close a session, tab, or window by accident you can undo it with “Edit > Undo” (⌘Z). By default you have five seconds to undo, but you can adjust that timeout in “Settings > Profiles > Session.”" = "如果你不小心关闭了会话、标签页或窗口，可以用“编辑 > 撤销”（⌘Z）撤销。默认有五秒钟可以撤销，但你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 会话”中调整该超时时间。";
"Annotations" = "注释";
"Want to mark up your scrollback history? Right click on a selection and choose “Annotate Selection” to add a personal note to it. Use “View > Show Annotations” to show or hide them, and look in “Edit > Marks and Annotations” for more things you can do." = "想在回滚历史中做标记吗？右键点击选区并选择“为选区添加注释”即可为其添加个人备注。用“视图 > 显示注释”来显示或隐藏它们，并在“编辑 > 标记和注释”中查看更多可用操作。";
"Copy with Styles" = "带样式复制";
"Copy a selection with ⌥⌘C to include styles such as colors and fonts. You can make this the default action for Copy in “Settings > Advanced.”" = "用 ⌥⌘C 复制选区可包含颜色和字体等样式。你可以在“设置 > 高级”中将此设为复制的默认行为。";
"Inline Images" = "内联图片";
"iTerm2 can display images (even animated GIFs) inline." = "iTerm2 可以内联显示图片（甚至是动态 GIF）。";
"Automatic Profile Switching" = "自动切换配置文件";
"Automatic Profile Switching changes the current profile when the username, hostname, or directory changes. Set it up in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced.” It requires Shell Integration to be installed." = "自动切换配置文件会在用户名、主机名或目录变化时切换当前配置文件。在“设置 > 配置文件 > 高级”中设置。它需要安装 Shell 集成。";
"Captured Output" = "捕获的输出";
"iTerm2 can act like an IDE using the Captured Output feature. When it sees text matching a regular expression you define, like compiler errors, it shows the matching lines in the Toolbelt. You can click to jump to the line in your terminal and double-click to perform an action like opening an editor to the line with the error." = "iTerm2 可通过捕获的输出功能像 IDE 一样工作。当它看到与你定义的正则表达式匹配的文本（如编译器错误）时，会在工具栏中显示匹配行。你可以点击跳转到终端中的该行，双击可执行操作（如在编辑器中打开出错行）。";
"Badges" = "徽章";
"You can display a status message in the top right of your session in the background. It’s called a “Badge.” If you install Shell Integration you can include info like user name, hostname, current directory, and more." = "你可以在会话右上角后台显示一条状态消息。它叫做“徽章”。如果安装了 Shell 集成，你可以包含用户名、主机名、当前目录等信息。";
"Dynamic Profiles" = "动态配置文件";
"Dynamic Profiles let you store your profiles as one or more JSON files. It’s great for batch creating and editing profiles." = "动态配置文件让你将配置文件存储为一个或多个 JSON 文件。它非常适合批量创建和编辑配置文件。";
"Advanced Paste" = "高级粘贴";
"“Edit > Paste Special > Advanced Paste” lets you preview and edit text before you paste. You get to tweak options, like how to handle control codes, or even to base-64 encode before pasting." = "“编辑 > 特殊粘贴 > 高级粘贴”让你在粘贴前预览和编辑文本。你可以调整选项，比如如何处理控制字符，甚至在粘贴前进行 base-64 编码。";
"Zoom" = "缩放";
"Ever wanted to focus on a block of lines without distraction, or limit Find to a single command’s output? Select the lines and choose “View > Zoom In on Selection.” The session’s contents will be temporarily replaced with the selection. Press “esc” to unzoom." = "是否想专注于一组行而不受干扰，或将查找限制在单个命令的输出中？选中这些行并选择“视图 > 放大选区”。会话内容将被临时替换为选区。按“esc”退出缩放。";
"Semantic History" = "语义历史";
"The “Semantic History” feature allows you to ⌘-click on a file or URL to open it." = "“语义历史”功能允许你按住 ⌘ 点击文件或 URL 来打开它。";
"Tmux Integration" = "Tmux 集成";
"If you use tmux, try running “tmux -CC” to get iTerm2’s tmux integration mode. The tmux windows show up as native iTerm2 windows, and you can use iTerm2’s keyboard shortcuts. It even works over ssh!" = "如果你使用 tmux，试试运行“tmux -CC”来获得 iTerm2 的 tmux 集成模式。tmux 窗口会显示为原生 iTerm2 窗口，你可以使用 iTerm2 的键盘快捷键。它甚至可以通过 ssh 使用！";
"Triggers" = "触发器";
"iTerm2 can automatically perform actions you define when text matching a regular expression is received. For example, you can highlight text or show an alert box. Set it up in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Triggers.”" = "iTerm2 可在收到与你定义的正则表达式匹配的文本时自动执行操作。例如，你可以高亮文本或显示警告框。在“设置 > 配置文件 > 高级 > 触发器”中设置。";
"Smart Selection" = "智能选择";
"Quadruple click to perform Smart Selection. It figures out if you’re selecting a URL, filename, email address, etc. based on prioritized regular expressions." = "四连击可执行智能选择。它会根据优先级正则表达式判断你选择的是 URL、文件名、电子邮件地址等。";
"Instant Replay" = "即时回放";
"Press ⌥⌘B to step back in time in a terminal window. Use arrow keys to go frame by frame. Hold ⇧ and press arrow keys to go faster." = "按 ⌥⌘B 可在终端窗口中回溯时间。用方向键逐帧前进。按住 ⇧ 再按方向键可加快速度。";
"Hotkey Window" = "快捷键窗口";
"You can have a terminal window open with a keystroke, even while in other apps. Click “Create a Dedicated Hotkey Window” in “Settings > Keys.”" = "你可以用快捷键打开终端窗口，即使在其他应用中也可以。在“设置 > 键”中点击“创建专用快捷键窗口”。";
"Hotkey windows can stay open after losing focus. Turn it on in “Window > Pin Hotkey Window.”" = "快捷键窗口在失去焦点后可以保持打开。在“窗口 > 固定快捷键窗口”中开启。";
"Cursor Guide" = "光标引导线";
"The cursor guide is a horizontal line that follows your cursor. You can turn it on in “Settings > Profiles > Colors” or toggle it with the ⌥⌘; shortcut." = "光标引导线是跟随光标的水平线。你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 颜色”中开启，或用 ⌥⌘; 快捷键切换。";
"Shell Integration: Alerts" = "Shell 集成：提醒";
"The Shell Integration feature lets you ask to be alerted (⌥⌘A) when a long-running command completes." = "Shell 集成功能可让你在长时间运行的命令完成时收到提醒（⌥⌘A）。";
"Cursor Blink Rate" = "光标闪烁频率";
"You can configure how quickly the cursor blinks in “Settings > Advanced.”" = "你可以在“设置 > 高级”中配置光标闪烁的速度。";
"Shell Integration: Navigation" = "Shell 集成：导航";
"The Shell Integration feature lets you navigate among shell prompts with ⇧⌘↑ and ⇧⌘↓." = "Shell 集成功能可让你用 ⇧⌘↑ 和 ⇧⌘↓ 在 shell 提示符之间导航。";
"Shell Integration: Status" = "Shell 集成：状态";
"The Shell Integration feature puts a blue arrow next to your shell prompt. If you run a command that fails, it turns red. Right click on it to get the running time and status." = "Shell 集成功能会在 shell 提示符旁放一个蓝色箭头。如果你运行的命令失败，它会变红。右键点击它可查看运行时间和状态。";
"Shell Integration: Selection" = "Shell 集成：选择";
"With Shell Integration installed, you can select the output of the last command with ⇧⌘A." = "安装 Shell 集成后，你可以用 ⇧⌘A 选择上一条命令的输出。";
"Bells" = "响铃";
"The dock icon shows a count of the number of bells rung and notifications posted since the app was last active." = "Dock 图标会显示自应用上次活动以来响铃和发布通知的次数。";
"Shell Integration: Downloads" = "Shell 集成：下载";
"If you install Shell Integration on a machine you ssh to, you can right click on a filename (for example, in the output of “ls”) and choose “Download with scp” to download the file." = "如果你在 ssh 连接的机器上安装了 Shell 集成，可以右键点击文件名（例如在“ls”的输出中）并选择“用 scp 下载”来下载文件。";
"Find Your Cursor" = "找到你的光标";
"Press ⌘/ to locate your cursor. It’s fun!" = "按 ⌘/ 定位你的光标。很有趣！";
"Customize Smart Selection" = "自定义智能选择";
"You can edit Smart Selection regular expressions in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Smart Selection.”" = "你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 高级 > 智能选择”中编辑智能选择正则表达式。";
"Smart Selection Actions" = "智能选择操作";
"Assign an action to a Smart Selection rule in “Settings > Profiles > Advanced > Smart Selection > Edit Actions.” They go in the context menu and override semantic history on ⌘-click." = "在“设置 > 配置文件 > 高级 > 智能选择 > 编辑操作”中为智能选择规则分配操作。它们会出现在上下文菜单中，并在 ⌘ 点击时覆盖语义历史。";
"Visual Bell" = "视觉响铃";
"If you want the visual bell to flash the whole screen instead of show a bell icon, you can turn that on in “Settings > Advanced.”" = "如果你想让视觉响铃闪烁整个屏幕而不是显示铃铛图标，可以在“设置 > 高级”中开启。";
"Tab Menu" = "标签页菜单";
"Right click on a tab to change its color, close tabs after it, or to close all other tabs." = "右键点击标签页可更改其颜色、关闭其后的标签页或关闭所有其他标签页。";
"Tags" = "标签";
"You can assign tags to your profiles, and by clicking “Tags>” anywhere you see a list of profiles you can browse those tags." = "你可以为配置文件分配标签，在任何配置文件列表中点击“标签>”即可浏览这些标签。";
"Tag Hierarchy" = "标签层级";
"If you put a slash in a profile’s tag, that implicitly defines a hierarchy. You can see it in the Profiles menu as nested submenus." = "如果在配置文件的标签中加斜杠，会隐式定义一个层级。你可以在“配置文件”菜单中看到它作为嵌套子菜单。";
"Downloads" = "下载";
"iTerm2 can download files by base-64 encoding them. Click “Learn More” to download a shell script that makes it easy." = "iTerm2 可通过 base-64 编码下载文件。点击“了解更多”下载一个简化此操作的 shell 脚本。";
"Command Completion" = "命令补全";
"If you install Shell Integration, ⇧⌘; helps you complete commands. It remembers the commands you’ve run on each host that has Shell Integration installed. It knows how often that command was run and how recently to help make the best suggestions." = "如果安装了 Shell 集成，⇧⌘; 可帮你补全命令。它会记住你在每个安装了 Shell 集成的主机上运行过的命令，并根据运行频率和近期程度给出最佳建议。";
"Recent Directories" = "最近目录";
"iTerm2 remembers which directories you use the most on each host that has Shell Integration installed. There’s a Toolbelt tool to browse them, and ⌥⌘/ gives you a popup sorted by frequency and recency of use." = "iTerm2 会记住你在每个安装了 Shell 集成的主机上最常用的目录。工具栏中有一个工具可浏览它们，⌥⌘/ 会弹出一个按使用频率和近期程度排序的列表。";
"Favorite Directories" = "收藏目录";
"If you have Shell Integration installed, you can “star” a directory to keep it always at the bottom of the Recent Directories tool in the Toolbelt. Right click and choose “Toggle Star.”" = "如果安装了 Shell 集成，你可以给目录加“星标”，使其始终显示在工具栏的最近目录工具底部。右键点击并选择“切换星标”。";
"Shell Integration History" = "Shell 集成历史";
"Install Shell Integration and turn on “Settings > General > Save copy/paste and command history to disk” to remember command history per host across restarts of iTerm2." = "安装 Shell 集成并开启“设置 > 通用 > 将复制/粘贴和命令历史保存到磁盘”，即可在 iTerm2 重启后按主机记住命令历史。";
"Paste File as Base64" = "将文件粘贴为 Base64";
"Copy a file to the pasteboard in Finder and then use “Edit > Paste Special > Paste File Base64-Encoded” for easy uploads of binary files. Use ”base64 -D” (or -d on Linux) on the remote host to decode it." = "在 Finder 中将文件拷贝到剪贴板，然后用“编辑 > 特殊粘贴 > 粘贴 Base64 编码的文件”即可轻松上传二进制文件。在远程主机上用“base64 -D”（Linux 上用 -d）解码。";
"Split Panes" = "分屏面板";
"You can split a tab into multiple panes with ⌘D and ⇧⌘D." = "你可以用 ⌘D 和 ⇧⌘D 将标签页拆分为多个分屏面板。";
"Adjust Split Panes" = "调整分屏面板";
"Resize split panes with the keyboard using ^⌘-Arrow Key." = "用键盘 ^⌘-方向键调整分屏面板大小。";
"Move Cursor" = "移动光标";
"Hold ⌥ and click to move your cursor. It works best with Shell Integration installed (to avoid sending up/down arrow keys to your shell)." = "按住 ⌥ 并点击可移动光标。安装 Shell 集成后效果最佳（可避免向 shell 发送上下方向键）。";
"Edge Windows" = "边缘窗口";
"You can tell your profile to create windows that are attached to one edge of the screen in “Settings > Profiles > Window.” You can resize them by dragging the edges." = "你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 窗口”中让配置文件创建附着在屏幕一侧的窗口。你可以通过拖动边缘调整大小。";
"Tab Color" = "标签页颜色";
"You can assign colors to tabs in “Settings > Profiles > Colors,” or in the View menu." = "你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 颜色”或视图菜单中为标签页分配颜色。";
"Rectangular Selection" = "矩形选择";
"Hold ⌥⌘ while dragging to make a rectangular selection." = "拖动时按住 ⌥⌘ 可进行矩形选择。";
"Multiple Selection" = "多重选择";
"Hold ⌘ while dragging to make multiple discontinuous selections." = "拖动时按住 ⌘ 可进行多个不连续的选择。";
"Dragging Panes" = "拖动分屏面板";
"Hold ⇧⌥⌘ and drag a session into another session to create or change split panes." = "按住 ⇧⌥⌘ 将一个会话拖入另一个会话可创建或更改分屏面板。";
"Cursor Boost" = "光标增强";
"Adjust Cursor Boost in “Settings > Profiles > Colors” to make all colors more muted, except the cursor. Use a bright white cursor and it pops!" = "在“设置 > 配置文件 > 颜色”中调整光标增强，可使除光标外的所有颜色更柔和。使用亮白色光标，它会非常醒目！";
"Minimum Contrast" = "最低对比度";
"Adjust “Minimum Contrast” in “Settings > Profiles > Colors” to ensure text is always legible regardless of text/background color combination." = "在“设置 > 配置文件 > 颜色”中调整“最低对比度”，可确保无论文本/背景颜色如何组合，文本始终清晰可读。";
"Tabs" = "标签页";
"Normally, new tabs appear at the end of the tab bar. There’s a setting in “Settings > Advanced” to place them next to your current tab." = "通常新标签页出现在标签栏末尾。在“设置 > 高级”中有一项设置可将它们放在当前标签页旁边。";
"Base Conversion" = "进制转换";
"Right-click on a number and the context menu shows it converted to hex or decimal as appropriate." = "右键点击数字，上下文菜单会显示其转换为十六进制或十进制的结果。";
"Saved Searches" = "保存的搜索";
"In “Settings > Keys” you can assign a keystroke to a search for a regular expression with the “Find Regular Expression…” action." = "在“设置 > 键”中，你可以用“查找正则表达式…”操作将快捷键分配给正则表达式搜索。";
"Find URLs" = "查找 URL";
"Search for URLs using “Edit > Find > Find URLs.” Navigate search results with ⌘G and ⇧⌘G. Open the current selection with ⌥⌘O." = "用“编辑 > 查找 > 查找 URL”搜索 URL。用 ⌘G 和 ⇧⌘G 导航搜索结果。用 ⌥⌘O 打开当前选择。";
"The “instant” checkbox in a Trigger allows it to fire while the cursor is on the same line as the text that matches your regular expression." = "触发器中的“即时”复选框允许它在光标与匹配正则表达式的文本位于同一行时触发。";
"Soft Boundaries" = "软边界";
"Turn on “Edit > Selection Respects Soft Boundaries” to recognize split pane dividers in programs like vi, emacs, and tmux so you can select multiple lines of text." = "开启“编辑 > 选区遵守软边界”可识别 vi、emacs 和 tmux 等程序中的分屏面板分隔符，从而选择多行文本。";
"Select Without Dragging" = "无需拖动即可选择";
"Single click where you want to start a selection and ⇧-click where you want it to end to select text without dragging." = "在想要开始选区的位置单击，在想要结束的位置按住 ⇧ 点击，即可无需拖动选择文本。";
"Smooth Window Resizing" = "平滑调整窗口大小";
"Hold ^ while resizing a window and it won’t snap to the character grid: you can make it any size you want." = "调整窗口大小时按住 ^，它不会对齐到字符网格：你可以调整为任意大小。";
"Pasting Tabs" = "粘贴制表符";
"If you paste text containing tabs, you’ll be asked if you want to convert them to spaces. It’s handy at the shell prompt to avoid triggering filename completion." = "如果你粘贴包含制表符的文本，系统会询问你是否将它们转换为空格。这在 shell 提示符处很方便，可避免触发文件名补全。";
"Bell Silencing" = "响铃静音";
"Did you know? If the bell rings too often, you’ll be asked if you’d like to silence it temporarily. iTerm2 cares about your comfort." = "你知道吗？如果响铃过于频繁，系统会询问你是否暂时静音。iTerm2 关心你的舒适体验。";
"Profile Search" = "配置文件搜索";
"Every list of profiles has a search field (e.g., in ”Settings > Profiles.”) You can use various operators to restrict your search query. Click “Learn More” for all the details." = "每个配置文件列表都有搜索框（例如在“设置 > 配置文件”中）。你可以使用各种运算符来限制搜索查询。点击“了解更多”获取所有详情。";
"Color Schemes" = "配色方案";
"The online color gallery features over one hundred beautiful color schemes you can download." = "在线配色库提供了一百多种可供下载的精美配色方案。";
"ASCII/Non-Ascii Fonts" = "ASCII/非 ASCII 字体";
"You can have a separate font for ASCII versus non-ASCII text. Enable it in “Settings > Profiles > Text.”" = "你可以为 ASCII 和非 ASCII 文本分别使用不同字体。在“设置 > 配置文件 > 文本”中启用。";
"Coprocesses" = "协处理";
"A coprocess is a job, such as a shell script, that has a special relationship with a particular iTerm2 session. All output in a terminal window (that is, what you see on the screen) is also input to the coprocess. All output from the coprocess acts like text that the user is typing at the keyboard." = "协处理是一个任务（如 shell 脚本），与特定 iTerm2 会话有特殊关系。终端窗口中的所有输出（即你在屏幕上看到的内容）也是协处理的输入。协处理的所有输出就像用户在键盘上输入的文本。";
"Touch Bar Customization" = "触控栏自定义";
"You can customize the touch bar by selecting “View > Customize Touch Bar.” You can add a tab bar for full-screen mode, a user-customizable status button, and you can even define your own touch bar buttons in Settings > Keys. There’s also a new shell integration tool to customize touch bar function key labels." = "你可以通过选择“视图 > 自定义触控栏”来自定义触控栏。你可以为全屏模式添加标签栏、用户可自定义的状态按钮，甚至可以在“设置 > 键”中定义自己的触控栏按钮。还有一个新的 shell 集成工具可自定义触控栏功能键标签。";
"Ligatures" = "连字";
"If you use a font that supports ligatures, you can enable ligature support in Settings > Profiles > Text." = "如果你使用支持连字的字体，可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 文本”中启用连字支持。";
"Floating Hotkey Window" = "浮动快捷键窗口";
"New in 3.1: You can configure your hotkey window to appear over other apps’ full screen windows. Turn on “Floating Window” in “Settings > Profiles > Keys > Customize Hotkey Window.”" = "3.1 新功能：你可以将快捷键窗口配置为显示在其他应用的全屏窗口之上。在“设置 > 配置文件 > 键 > 自定义快捷键窗口”中开启“浮动窗口”。";
"Multiple Hotkey Windows" = "多个快捷键窗口";
"New in 3.1: You can have multiple hotkey windows. Each profile can have one or more hotkeys." = "3.1 新功能：你可以拥有多个快捷键窗口。每个配置文件可以有一个或多个快捷键。";
"Double-Tap Hotkey" = "双击快捷键";
"New in 3.1: You can configure a hotkey window to open on double-tap of a modifier in “Settings > Profiles > Keys > Customize Hotkey Window.”" = "3.1 新功能：你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 键 > 自定义快捷键窗口”中配置快捷键窗口在双击修饰键时打开。";
"Buried Sessions" = "隐藏的会话";
"You can “bury” a session with “Session > Bury Session.” It remains hidden until you restore it by selecting it from “Session > Buried Sessions > Your session.”" = "你可以用“会话 > 隐藏会话”来“隐藏”一个会话。它会保持隐藏，直到你从“会话 > 已隐藏的会话 > 你的会话”中选择恢复。";
"Python API" = "Python API";
"You can add custom behavior to iTerm2 using the Python API." = "你可以使用 Python API 为 iTerm2 添加自定义行为。";
"Status Bar" = "状态栏";
"You can add a configurable status bar to your terminal windows." = "你可以为终端窗口添加可配置的状态栏。";
"Minimal Theme" = "极简主题";
"Try the “Minimal” and “Compact” themes to reduce visual clutter. You can set it in “Settings > Appearance > General.”" = "试试“极简”和“紧凑”主题以减少视觉杂乱。你可以在“设置 > 外观 > 通用”中设置。";
"Session Titles" = "会话标题";
"You can configure which elements are present in session titles in “Settings > Profiles > General > Title.”" = "你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 通用 > 标题”中配置会话标题中包含哪些元素。";
"Tab Icons" = "标签页图标";
"Tabs can show an icon indicating the current application. Configure it in “Settings > Profiles > General > Icon.”" = "标签页可显示指示当前应用的图标。在“设置 > 配置文件 > 通用 > 图标”中配置。";
"Drag Window by Tab" = "通过标签页拖动窗口";
"Hold ⌥ while dragging a tab to move the window. This is useful in the Compact and Minimal themes, which have a very small area for dragging the window." = "拖动标签页时按住 ⌥ 可移动窗口。这在紧凑和极简主题中很有用，因为它们用于拖动窗口的区域很小。";
"Composer" = "编辑器";
"Press ⇧⌘. to open the Composer. It gives you a scratchpad to edit a command before sending it to the shell." = "按 ⇧⌘. 打开编辑器。它提供一个临时编辑区，让你在将命令发送到 shell 前先编辑。";
"Shell Integration: Uploads" = "Shell 集成：上传";
"If you install Shell Integration on a machine you ssh to, you can drag-drop from Finder into the remote host by holding ⌥ while dragging. The destination directory is determined by where you drop the file in the terminal window: run cd foo, then drop the file below the cd command, and the file will go into the foo directory." = "如果你在 ssh 连接的机器上安装了 Shell 集成，可以按住 ⌥ 从 Finder 拖放文件到远程主机。目标目录由你在终端窗口中放置文件的位置决定：运行 cd foo，然后将文件放在 cd 命令下方，文件就会进入 foo 目录。";
"Composer Power Features" = "编辑器高级功能";
"The composer supports multiple cursors. It also has the ability to send just one command out of a list, making it easy to walk through a list of commands one-by-one. Click the help button in the composer for details." = "编辑器支持多光标。它还能从列表中仅发送一条命令，便于逐条执行命令列表。点击编辑器中的帮助按钮了解详情。";
"Render Selection" = "渲染选区";
"Transform selected text into a prettified, syntax-highlighted view with the “Render Selection” command, ideal for JSON, Markdown, or source code. This feature includes horizontal scrolling for easy log navigation." = "用“渲染选区”命令将选中文本转换为美化、语法高亮的视图，非常适合 JSON、Markdown 或源代码。此功能包含水平滚动，便于日志导航。";
"SSH Integration" = "SSH 集成";
"Export environment variables and copy files to remote hosts seamlessly with SSH integration. Either configure a profile to use ssh or use it2ssh in place of ssh." = "通过 SSH 集成无缝导出环境变量和拷贝文件到远程主机。可以配置配置文件使用 ssh，或用 it2ssh 代替 ssh。";
"Auto Composer" = "自动编辑器";
"Improve your command line with the “auto composer”, which replaces the command line with a native control for ease of use. Requires shell integration." = "用“自动编辑器”改进你的命令行，它用原生控件替换命令行以方便使用。需要 Shell 集成。";
"AI Command Writing" = "AI 命令编写";
"Generate commands using AI by entering a prompt in the composer and selecting “Edit > Engage Artificial Intelligence”. An OpenAI API key is required for this functionality." = "在编辑器中输入提示并选择“编辑 > 启用人工智能”，即可用 AI 生成命令。此功能需要 OpenAI API 密钥。";
"Codecierge Tool" = "Codecierge 工具";
"Set and achieve terminal goals with “Codecierge”, a Toolbelt feature that guides you step-by-step based on your terminal activity. An OpenAI API key is necessary for this feature." = "用“Codecierge”设定并实现终端目标，这是一个工具栏功能，会根据你的终端活动逐步引导你。此功能需要 OpenAI API 密钥。";
"Named Marks" = "命名标记";
"Navigate your command history effortlessly with “named marks” by assigning names to lines in the terminal." = "用“命名标记”为终端中的行分配名称，轻松导航你的命令历史。";
"Font Assignments" = "字体分配";
"You can assign specific fonts to Unicode ranges. Use 'Settings > Profiles > Text > Manage Special Exceptions' to manage it and to install a huge set of Powerline symbols." = "你可以为 Unicode 区段分配特定字体。用“设置 > 配置文件 > 文本 > 管理特殊例外”来管理，并安装大量 Powerline 符号。";
"Disable Transparency" = "禁用透明度";
"Maintain clarity in your active window while enjoying transparency in background windows by using 'View > Disable transparency in key window'." = "用“视图 > 在关键窗口中禁用透明度”，可在活动窗口中保持清晰，同时在背景窗口中享受透明效果。";
"Leader Shortcut" = "前导键快捷键";
"Create two-keystroke shortcuts with a “leader”: a special keystroke that precedes a custom key binding." = "用“前导键”创建双键快捷键：一种在自定义按键绑定之前的特殊按键。";
"Sequence Binding" = "序列绑定";
"Execute a series of actions in order with a single shortcut using “sequence” key bindings." = "用“序列”按键绑定，通过单个快捷键按顺序执行一系列操作。";
"Export/Import Settings" = "导出/导入设置";
"Easily backup or transfer your iTerm2 settings using the Export/Import feature in “Settings > General > Settings”." = "用“设置 > 通用 > 设置”中的导出/导入功能，轻松备份或传输你的 iTerm2 设置。";
"Multi-Session Bindings" = "多会话绑定";
"Apply key bindings uniformly across multiple sessions for consistent control in different tabs or windows." = "在多个会话中统一应用按键绑定，以便在不同标签页或窗口中保持一致的控制。";
"Inject Trigger" = "注入触发器";
"Simulate terminal input as if it were output from a running app with the “Inject” trigger." = "用“注入”触发器模拟终端输入，就像来自运行中应用的输出一样。";
"Trigger Status Bar" = "触发器状态栏";
"Easily manage your triggers using the new Triggers status bar component." = "使用新的触发器状态栏组件轻松管理你的触发器。";
"Session Size in Tab" = "标签页中显示会话大小";
"Display session size directly in tab titles for convenient at-a-glance information." = "在标签页标题中直接显示会话大小，方便一目了然。";
"Advanced Snippet Editing" = "高级代码片段编辑";
"Edit snippets in Advanced Paste by holding the ⌥ key, or open them in the composer with ⇧." = "在高级粘贴中按住 ⌥ 键编辑代码片段，或用 ⇧ 在编辑器中打开它们。";
"HTML Logs" = "HTML 日志";
"Save your terminal logs in HTML format for enhanced readability and sharing capabilities." = "以 HTML 格式保存终端日志，增强可读性和分享能力。";
"ASCIICast Logs" = "ASCIICast 日志";
"Create and play back terminal recordings with ASCIICast logs, compatible with asciinema." = "用 ASCIICast 日志创建和回放终端录制，兼容 asciinema。";
"Timestamped Logs" = "带时间戳的日志";
"Include timestamps in your logs for better tracking and event correlation." = "在日志中包含时间戳，便于跟踪和事件关联。";
"LastPass & 1Password" = "LastPass 和 1Password";
"Utilize LastPass or 1Password with the password manager by configuring it in the menu next to the search field." = "通过搜索框旁边的菜单配置，可在密码管理器中使用 LastPass 或 1Password。";
"Password Manager Access" = "密码管理器访问";
"Access your password manager without authentication by adjusting the settings via the menu next to its search field." = "通过搜索框旁边的菜单调整设置，无需认证即可访问密码管理器。";
"Password Generation" = "密码生成";
"Generate strong, secure passwords using the password manager’s new password generation feature." = "使用密码管理器的新密码生成功能生成强健、安全的密码。";
"it2tip Utility" = "it2tip 工具";
"Access tips of the day with the it2tip utility, a command line app. Enable it by installing shell integration and utilities." = "用 it2tip 工具（一个命令行应用）访问每日提示。通过安装 Shell 集成和工具来启用它。";
"Auto Shell Integration" = "自动 Shell 集成";
"Experience automatic shell integration when creating a login shell, removing the need for explicit setup on your Mac." = "创建登录 shell 时体验自动 Shell 集成，无需在 Mac 上手动设置。";
"Command Prompt Info" = "命令提示信息";
"Get detailed information about commands by ⌘-clicking on the command prompt." = "按住 ⌘ 点击命令提示符可获取命令的详细信息。";
"tmux Integration" = "tmux 集成";
"Use tmux integration for automatic key bindings that emulate tmux’s shortcuts, configurable via the Leader settings." = "使用 tmux 集成可获得模拟 tmux 快捷键的自动按键绑定，可通过前导键设置配置。";
"tmux Clipboard Mirroring" = "tmux 剪贴板镜像";
"Sync your tmux paste buffer with the local clipboard for seamless integration (requires tmux 3.4)." = "将 tmux 粘贴缓冲区与本地剪贴板同步以实现无缝集成（需要 tmux 3.4）。";
"Multi-Cursor in Composer" = "编辑器中的多光标";
"Enhance your editing in the Composer with multiple cursors, created using ^⇧-up/down or ⌥-drag." = "在编辑器中用多光标增强编辑，通过 ^⇧-上/下或 ⌥-拖动创建。";
"Advanced Paste from Composer" = "从编辑器高级粘贴";
"Move content from the Composer to the Advanced Paste window with ⌥⌘V for additional editing options." = "用 ⌥⌘V 将内容从编辑器移到高级粘贴窗口，以获得更多编辑选项。";
"Composer Search" = "编辑器搜索";
"Search within the Composer using ⌘F to quickly find specific text." = "在编辑器中用 ⌘F 快速查找特定文本。";
"Resize Composer" = "调整编辑器大小";
"Adjust the Composer’s height to suit your needs by dragging its bottom edge." = "拖动编辑器底边可调整其高度以适应你的需求。";
"Explain Command" = "解释命令";
"Learn more about your commands by ⌘-clicking in the Composer to open them in explainshell.com." = "在编辑器中按住 ⌘ 点击命令可在 explainshell.com 中打开，了解更多信息。";
"Quick Command Send" = "快速发送命令";
"Quickly send and remove commands in the Composer using ⌥⇧-enter." = "在编辑器中用 ⌥⇧-enter 快速发送并移除命令。";
"Queue Commands" = "排队命令";
"Queue up a command in the Composer to be sent after the current command finishes with ⌥-Enter." = "在编辑器中用 ⌥-Enter 将命令排队，在当前命令完成后发送。";
"Draggable Tip Window" = "可拖动的提示窗口";
"Reposition the Tip of the Day window conveniently on your screen, as it is now draggable." = "现在可以拖动每日提示窗口，方便地在屏幕上重新定位。";
"AI Chat" = "AI 对话";
"iTerm2 now has an AI Chat feature! Use “Window > AI Chats” or “Edit > Explain Output with AI”. The assistant can interact with your terminal (with your permission) and explain command output, adding annotations right in the terminal." = "iTerm2 现在有 AI 对话功能！用“窗口 > AI 对话”或“编辑 > 用 AI 解释输出”。助手可以（经你许可）与终端交互并解释命令输出，直接在终端中添加注释。";
"Web Browser Profiles" = "浏览器配置文件";
"You can configure a profile to be a web browser! In “Settings > Profiles > General”, set “Profile Type” to “Web Browser”. Key bindings, smart selection, and the password manager all work in browser sessions." = "你可以将配置文件配置为浏览器！在“设置 > 配置文件 > 通用”中，将“配置文件类型”设为“浏览器”。按键绑定、智能选择和密码管理器都能在浏览器会话中使用。";
"Adjacent Timestamps" = "相邻时间戳";
"Timestamps can now be shown next to terminal content instead of overlapping. Configure it in “Settings > Profiles > Session > Timestamps”. Right-click on any line and select “Set Baseline for Relative Timestamps” to see time elapsed between lines." = "时间戳现在可以显示在终端内容旁边而不是重叠。在“设置 > 配置文件 > 会话 > 时间戳”中配置。右键点击任意行并选择“为相对时间戳设置基准”可查看行之间的时间差。";
"Pretty-Print JSON" = "格式化 JSON";
"Select a block of JSON text and choose “Edit > Replace Selection > Replace with Pretty-Printed JSON” to make it readable. Perfect for debugging API responses and log files." = "选择一块 JSON 文本并选择“编辑 > 替换选区 > 替换为格式化的 JSON”使其可读。非常适合调试 API 响应和日志文件。";
"Command Palette" = "命令面板";
"Open Quickly (⇧⌘O) is now a command palette! Just type the name of a menu item to activate it." = "快速打开（⇧⌘O）现在是一个命令面板！只需输入菜单项名称即可激活它。";
"Click Paths in Shell Prompts" = "点击 shell 提示符中的路径";
"Enable “Settings > Profiles > Terminal > Click on a path in a shell prompt to open Navigator” to navigate your filesystem by clicking on paths in your prompt. Requires Shell Integration." = "启用“设置 > 配置文件 > 终端 > 点击 shell 提示符中的路径以打开导航器”，即可通过点击提示符中的路径来导航文件系统。需要 Shell 集成。";
"SSH File Browser" = "SSH 文件浏览器";
"When connected via SSH Integration, use “Shell > ssh > Download Files” to browse and download files from the remote host without opening a new connection. Files on SSH hosts also appear in file open/save dialogs!" = "通过 SSH 集成连接时，用“Shell > ssh > 下载文件”可浏览和下载远程主机上的文件，无需打开新连接。SSH 主机上的文件也会出现在文件打开/保存对话框中！";
